WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.209
Learn to model number quantities, place value for multi-digit using graph sheets or

00:00:06.209 --> 00:00:13.142
multi-base materials up to 100,000 and read and write numbers in figures and in words

00:00:13.142 --> 00:00:14.067
up 100,000

00:00:14.867 --> 00:00:26.317
How many complete groups of 1 are in 14,682? The answer is 14682. 14,682 divided by 1

00:00:26.317 --> 00:00:29.011
has 14682 complete groups.

00:00:29.867 --> 00:00:35.892
A school has 72,215 bottle tops. How many complete bundles of 10 can it make? Pause

00:00:35.892 --> 00:00:38.528
and solve it in your exercise book.

00:00:39.367 --> 00:00:49.223
The answer is 7221. 72,215 divided by 10 gives 7221 full bundles.
